---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout>
  <section class="home-hero site-shell">
    <p class="eyebrow">DAVIS / ENGINEERING NOTES</p>
    <h1>在变化的技术里，记录不易过时的工程判断。</h1>
    <p>
      关于 Agent、RAG、Java 后端与可靠软件工程。关注真实系统里的上下文、状态、权限、评测和恢复，而不只追逐框架名称。
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="post-section site-shell" aria-labelledby="latest-posts">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <h2 id="latest-posts">最新文章</h2>
      <span>1 篇</span>
    </div>

    <a class="post-card" href="/posts/agent-anchor/">
      <img
        src="/assets/images/agent-anchor-cover.png"
        alt="海面上的技术变化与海面下的工程锚点"
        width="1672"
        height="941"
      />
      <div class="post-card-body">
        <div class="post-card-meta">2026-08-30 · Agent Engineering</div>
        <h3>Agent 时代下的锚点</h3>
        <p>从 Java 后端与企业知识检索实践出发，梳理 Agent 从 Demo 走向生产环境时不会轻易过时的八类工程能力。</p>
        <span class="read-more">阅读全文 →</span>
      </div>
    </a>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
